{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a 2D pixel style aircraft carrier deck management game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will become a ground crew member with different functions on the deck of China's third aircraft carrier, the Fujian, commanding the transportation, refueling, ammunition loading, takeoff, and landing of carrier based aircraft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy doesn't know when they will appear, and all you need to do is prepare the fighter jets on the deck as soon as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/extras/21b34798ef6b1d94e58faf4ebc380a22.poster.avif?t=1772955377\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/extras/21b34798ef6b1d94e58faf4ebc380a22.webm?t=1772955377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/extras/21b34798ef6b1d94e58faf4ebc380a22.mp4?t=1772955377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fast-paced time management game. Time is life, you need to make decisions quickly and give accurate commands. Don't repeat the indecisiveness of a commander who lost three aircraft carriers in five minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/extras/fd2ecd1b2eef3583734dde4890d7a821.poster.avif?t=1772955377\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/extras/fd2ecd1b2eef3583734dde4890d7a821.webm?t=1772955377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/extras/fd2ecd1b2eef3583734dde4890d7a821.mp4?t=1772955377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/extras/0aef053957743027c604ff23fe15f23e.poster.avif?t=1772955377\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/extras/0aef053957743027c604ff23fe15f23e.webm?t=1772955377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/extras/0aef053957743027c604ff23fe15f23e.mp4?t=1772955377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level content:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains multiple fictional historical combat missions. Helps you familiarize and understand game operations and core gameplay in the early stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, it also includes three different difficulty levels of endless modes, where enemies will attack wave after wave, and you can see how long you can lead this giant ship to persist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featured gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each wave of enemies is cleared, a random gain reward will appear, which helps to complete battles more efficiently in subsequent waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to enhancing the work efficiency of ground personnel, the participation and assistance of new models of fighter jets such as J35 and KJ600 can also be obtained.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4027740?t=1772955377","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4027740?t=1772955377","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027740/83d8c83976adfb29325c44b7adaa552e07a94111/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772955377","capsu